From: Devario maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] use native key and database helpers at runtime

Devario intentionally does not install the pacman or pacman-key executables.
Use Shelly's own key helper for supported keyring and repository operations and
invoke GnuPG directly for network key operations. Resolve pacfile ownership
from the local ALPM database instead of spawning pacman -Qoq.

